<speak>
<s>This is your briefing for <say-as interpret-as="date" format="dmy">06092026</say-as>.</s>
<break time="1s"/>
<prosody rate="95%">
<s>The Strait of Hormuz is closing by attrition rather than by declaration.</s> <s>United States Central Command struck three Iranian oil tankers on Saturday, and Iran's Revolutionary Guard says it answered by targeting six vessels transiting what it calls unauthorised routes — both navies now firing at commercial hulls with civilian crews aboard, not at each other.</s> <s>Tehran insists ships must hug its own coastline rather than the Omani side, a reading it draws from an accord that expired in June... and the insurers who price that risk are already pricing neutral crews out of the corridor entirely.</s>
</prosody>
<p>
<s>In politics.</s><break time="400ms"/>
<s>Iranian investigators say fragments recovered from a wedding gathering in Sirik, in Hormozgan province, came from an American-made glide bomb.</s> <s>The weapon they name has no engine — it's released at a fixed set of coordinates and falls to them, which makes a stray round an implausible explanation, and local assessments put the toll at five killed and seventy wounded.</s> <s>No independent investigators have verified Tehran's account, and that asymmetry is itself the story: this war's dead are being counted by whoever holds the debris.</s>
<break time="600ms"/>
<s>In Pakistan's Balochistan, Chief Minister Sarfraz Bugti told the provincial assembly that roughly one thousand people in a nomadic settlement at Shor Parod will be relocated so a security operation can proceed.</s> <s>He called it temporary and spoke of creating an enabling environment for the forces, but the announcement named no destination, no compensation figure, and no return date — and the province has a long record of relocations that never reversed.</s> <s>A pastoral community that is not party to the fighting has become the precondition for it.</s>
<break time="600ms"/>
<s>A special court in Jagdalpur convicted all ten surviving defendants in the Jhiram Ghati ambush that killed twenty-seven people, most of Chhattisgarh's Congress state leadership.</s> <s>Thirteen years passed between the attack and the verdict, and the phrase surviving defendants carries its own arithmetic — eleven were charged, and one died before judgment arrived.</s> <s>Sentencing comes in mid-September, but the wider conspiracy Congress has alleged for a decade was never what this court was asked to decide.</s>
<break time="600ms"/>
<s>Anak Krakatau erupted, and ash reached Jakarta a hundred and fifty kilometres away, shutting Soekarno-Hatta airport and stranding two hundred and nine flights and twenty-two thousand eight hundred passengers.</s> <s>There's no partial-risk regime for volcanic ash — silicate glass melts inside a jet engine's hot section and refuses onto the turbine blades, so airspace either opens or it closes.</s> <s>Southeast Asia's fourth-busiest hub sits in the plume path of a volcano that has been erupting since nineteen twenty-seven, which concentrates a nation's connectivity in one column of smoke.</s>
<break time="600ms"/>
<s>Australia's Coalition would make burning the national flag a criminal offence carrying a year in prison, and would fix the twenty-sixth of January in statute as Australia Day.</s> <s>That's the date Indigenous Australians mark as Invasion Day, and the package criminalises symbolic political speech at the same moment it entrenches the symbol.</s> <s>Angus Taylor denies the bill is aimed at outflanking One Nation — but a minor party's platform is becoming law without that party winning the seats to pass it.</s>
<break time="600ms"/>
<s>Nigeria's National Assembly has dissolved its ad hoc oversight committees, and not one of them ever filed a report.</s> <s>Ad hoc committees are temporary bodies bound to report within a fixed deadline, and their unfinished probes into public spending and scandal now end with no findings at all.</s> <s>The Clerk's office will hold the records... which is a quieter way of saying nobody will read them.</s>
<break time="600ms"/>
<s>Police in Saxony found twelve explosive charges planted along high-voltage power lines.</s> <s>They weren't placed to topple the pylons but to induce a short circuit, and a single regional fault can trip protection relays and darken much of eastern Germany.</s> <s>Authorities are searching for a forty-eight-year-old suspect, and the interior ministry is treating grid sabotage as the infrastructure question of the season.</s>
</p>
<p>
<s>On the economy.</s><break time="400ms"/>
<s>Gasoline in the United States reached four dollars and three cents a gallon, past the record set in twenty twelve, with diesel at a record too.</s> <s>Brent crude hit ninety-six dollars a barrel, up more than ten percent in a month, and American refineries are already running near their twenty-eighteen peak — so there's almost no slack left to absorb the Hormuz shock.</s> <s>Diesel is what moves freight and food, which means the strait's price is being paid in supermarkets far from the Gulf.</s>
<break time="600ms"/>
<s>South Korea is weighing whether to send warships toward Hormuz on the strength of a single word in its own law.</s> <s>Hormuz carried sixty-one percent of Korean crude imports last year, and one term in the statute would let President Lee Jae Myung deploy forces near Iran's war without a parliamentary vote.</s> <s>Seoul is discovering that the security cost of a chokepoint gets billed to whoever depends on it most.</s>
<break time="600ms"/>
<s>Termination of Temporary Protected Status for Haitians has pulled work permits from care workers across America, and on Long Island a disabled man lost the aide who had looked after him for years.</s> <s>Temporary Protected Status is a discretionary label that one administrative decision can revoke, regardless of conditions in Haiti, where over a million people are displaced.</s> <s>Three hundred and fifty thousand people lost that status — and the cost is landing on disabled clients who were never the policy's target.</s>
<break time="600ms"/>
<s>Months after Britain's government rejected a ten-thousand-home new town at Adlington in Cheshire, developers have returned with plans for one thousand two hundred and seventy-five homes on the same green-belt land.</s> <s>An eighth the size is small enough to clear a local council alone, below the threshold that triggers national scrutiny — so the land-use decision gets made anyway, in pieces.</s> <s>The developer chose the size, not the residents who defeated the first scheme.</s>
<break time="600ms"/>
<s>Bitcoin trades near eighty thousand dollars, and desks that fill large orders say the asset has grown harder to trade even as its daily volatility has fallen.</s> <s>Returns concentrate into roughly ten sessions a year, so a fund out of the market on the wrong day turns a winning year into a losing one — that's execution risk, not price risk.</s> <s>Pension and treasury allocators are newly exposed to an asset whose screen price and fillable price part company exactly when everyone needs it most.</s>
</p>
<p>
<s>In science.</s><break time="400ms"/>
<s>A new fossil skull from the Los Colorados Formation in northwestern Argentina is the earliest-diverging member yet found of the lineage whose only survivor is New Zealand's tuatara.</s> <s>Earliest-diverging describes a position on the family tree rather than the oldest bone in the ground, and placing that deep branch in the southern supercontinent is an argument about Gondwana itself.</s> <s>A phylogeny assembled largely from northern fossils keeps getting rewritten from the south.</s>
<break time="600ms"/>
<s>Resting-state brain scans have found altered network activity in people who get migraines without aura — the group with no visual warning sign to report.</s> <s>These patients are diagnosed on description alone, which is why they're routinely dismissed and under-treated, and women carry roughly three times the prevalence.</s> <s>An imaging correlate isn't yet a clinical test, in sha'Allah it becomes one, but for now it's evidence that something measurable was always there.</s>
<break time="600ms"/>
<s>Steam turned barley straw into a sponge for pharmaceutical residues, nearly quadrupling its surface area from one hundred and nineteen to four hundred and twenty-three square metres per gram.</s> <s>Drug residues that treatment plants miss keep flowing into rivers and drinking supplies, and pelletising the biochar lets it work inside flow-through filters rather than as loose powder.</s> <s>An agricultural waste product becomes water infrastructure — if anyone builds it at scale.</s>
</p>
<p>
<s>In technology.</s><break time="400ms"/>
<s>The Seattle Times and Newsday filed suit against OpenAI and Microsoft on the same day, in the same New York federal court where the Times case already sits.</s> <s>Regional dailies have no licensing leverage individually, so litigation is their only route to the terms national publishers negotiated privately and quietly.</s> <s>If local newsrooms can't fund reporting, the models lose the ground truth they're trained on... and so does everyone reading them.</s>
<break time="600ms"/>
<s>Researchers at Japan's Institute for Molecular Science added a single repulsive term to AlphaFold3 and unlocked protein shapes the model had been hiding.</s> <s>Proteins do their work by changing shape, not by holding one, and pushing the model away from its own prior answers forced it to produce alternatives.</s> <s>The fix hints that other generative models are similarly collapsed onto their most confident guess.</s>
<break time="600ms"/>
<s>Concrete made with twenty percent ground shell powder still tests at structural grade, according to a machine-learning screening study.</s> <s>Shells are calcium carbonate, the same mineral cement is baked from — so skipping the kiln skips the emissions from one of the largest industrial carbon sources on earth.</s> <s>The researchers are careful: it's a screening tool, not a structural code, and the gap between those two is measured in years.</s>
</p>
<break time="1s"/>
<prosody rate="90%">
<s>That's your briefing.</s>
</prosody>
</speak>